Rules:
1. Every group gets a short descriptive name in the same language as the messages (30 characters max).
2. A message id may appear in at most one group.
3. Messages that clearly belong to no group: leave them out of every group (the UI shows them as ungrouped).
4. Prefer fewer, broader groups over many tiny ones; a single stray message does not need its own group.

